 role="tab" aria-controls="tab-additional_information"> <a class="wd-nav-link" href="#tab-additional_information"> <span class="nav-link-text wd-tabs-title"> Additional information </span> </a></li></ul></div><div class="wd-accordion-item"><div id="tab-item-title-description" class="wd-accordion-title wd-opener-pos-right tab-title-description wd-active" data-accordion-index="description"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"> <span> Description </span></div> <span class="wd-accordion-opener wd-opener-style-arrow"></span></div><div class="entry-content woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description wd-active panel wc-tab" id="tab-description" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-description" data-accordion-index="description"><div class="wc-tab-inner"><div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="17975" class="elementor elementor-17975" data-elementor-post-type="product"><div class="wd-negative-gap elementor-element elementor-element-1e65cc41 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="1e65cc41" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aee000b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="aee000b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">ND018TCM360360-A01 | Circular Display 1.8 inch 360x360 Pixels IPS Display QSPI Interface</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d9f9f color-scheme-inherit text-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d9f9f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>The ND018TCM360360-A01 is a 1.8-inch round TFT display designed for high-quality visual performance in compact applications. Featuring a 360&#215;360 resolution 1.8” TFT panel, this circle display / circular display screen delivers sharp details, vivid colors, and wide viewing angles in all directions. Its transmissive display mode ensures clear visuals under various lighting conditions.</p><p>With a QSPI interface and a 15-pin connector, the ND018TCM360360-A01 is compatible with Arduino and similar development boards, making it ideal for prototyping and integration. The display offers a luminance of 450 nits, providing bright and clear visuals even in well-lit environments.</p><p>Key specifications include a 2.8V supply voltage, ST77916 controller, and a robust operating temperature range of -10°C to 60°C, with storage temperatures from -20°C to 70°C. Its full-view design and compact 48.08 x 49.59 x 1.96 mm outline make it a versatile choice for round LCD display modules, wearables, instrumentation, smart devices, and custom electronics.</p><p>Whether you are developing Arduino projects with a round LCD or looking for premium round LCD display modules, the ND018TCM360360-A01 delivers reliable performance and vivid visuals for a wide range of applications.</p><p>Search Keywords: 1.8 inch, 360&#215;360 Resolution, round display, circular screen, round lcd, circle display, round lcd display arduino, round tft display, round tft lcd, circular lcd screen, circular lcd displays, circle oled display, round touchscreen</p><h2><strong>General Specifications</strong></h2><table width="700"><tbody><tr><td width="196">Part No.: </td><td width="504">ND018TCM360360-A01</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Size: </td><td width="504">1.8 inch</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Display Format:</td><td width="504">360&#215;360 Resolution</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Display Type:</td><td width="504">IPS Display</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Display Mode:</td><td width="504">Transmissive</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Touchscreen:</td><td width="504">No (Optional with Yes)</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Optimal View:</td><td width="504">Full View</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Outline Dimension:</td><td width="504">48.08(H) x49.59(V) x1.96(T) mm</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Active Area:</td><td width="504">45.68(H) x 45.668 (V) mm</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Supply Voltage:</td><td width="504">2.8V</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Luminance</td><td width="504">450 nits</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Interface:</td><td width="504">QSPI</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Connection Type:</td><td width="504">10 pins connector</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Controller：</td><td width="504">ST77916</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Compatibility:</td><td width="504">Arduino and similar development boards</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Operating Temperature:</td><td>-10°C ~ 60°C</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Storage Temperature: </td><td>-20°C ~ 70°C</td></tr><tr><td width="196">Mount Frame:</td><td width="504">None</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="wd-negative-gap elementor-element elementor-element-0dc6db2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="0dc6db2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9359882 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9359882" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Display Drawing</h2></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-524acba e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="524acba" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8760b93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="8760b93" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-src="https://www.nosedisplay.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/tft-1.8-inch-360x360-resolution-circular-lcd-qspi-connector-drawing-1131x800.webp" data-srcset="https://www.no